| `apps/agent-coordinator/src/app/auth/jwt_handler.py` | `aitbc.auth.jwt` + `aitbc.auth.password` + `aitbc.auth.api_key` |
| `apps/agent-coordinator/src/app/auth/permissions.py` | `aitbc.auth.permissions` |
| `apps/agent-coordinator/src/app/auth/middleware.py` | `aitbc.auth.middleware` |
